      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "谈到「习惯与责任」，每个人的经历和选择都不一样。",
       "alumno": "In «habits and responsibilities», each person's experiences and choices are different.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "回顾一段经历时，既要看当时的条件，也要看后来作出的决定。",
       "alumno": "When looking back on an experience, it's worth considering both the conditions at the time and the decisions made afterwards.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "不同来源有时会强调问题的不同方面，比较它们有助于发现遗漏。",
       "alumno": "Sometimes different sources stress different aspects of a problem; comparing them helps to spot what is missing.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "写作时要解释这些材料如何支持主要观点。",
       "alumno": "When writing, explain how these materials support the main idea.",
       "literal": "",
